# Automap of the software renderer (issue #246): the player walks, opens the automap and goes through its keys:
# the cheat of the lines and of the things (iddt twice), grid, marks, follow, rotate, big, the three states of TAB,
# clear marks. Every frame is hashed by -framehash: old and new program must give the same lines.
hold 40 forward 25
hold 20 forward 25 turn 3
key 9
hold 3
shot 1
hold 12 forward 25 turn -2
shot 2
# iddt: every line of the map
key 105
hold 2
key 100
hold 2
key 100
hold 2
key 116
hold 3
shot 3
# iddt again: the things
key 105
hold 2
key 100
hold 2
key 100
hold 2
key 116
hold 3
shot 4
# the grid
key 103
hold 3
shot 5
# two marks
key 109
hold 3 forward 25
key 109
hold 3
shot 6
# follow off, the player moves on the map
key 102
hold 20 forward 25 turn 3
shot 7
# big (the whole level)
key 111
hold 3
shot 8
key 111
hold 3
# rotate on, follow on
key 114
hold 3
key 102
hold 20 forward 25 turn -3
shot 9
hold 10 forward 25 turn 3
shot 10
# clear the marks
key 99
hold 3
shot 11
# rotate on again
key 114
hold 12 forward 25 turn 3
shot 14
# TAB: the next state of the automap (overlay or off), then the next
key 9
hold 3
shot 12
key 9
hold 3
shot 13
key 9
hold 3
hold 20 forward 25 turn 2
